    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl mix together the cream cheese, sour cream, and green onions. Season with salt and pepper if desired.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/creamy-mushroom-keto-casserole/#wprm-recipe-52663-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/creamy-mushroom-casserole-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread the cream cheese mixture onto the cauliflower.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/creamy-mushroom-keto-casserole/#wprm-recipe-52663-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/creamy-mushroom-casserole-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix the top of the casserole together until the cream cheese mixture coats all of the vegetables.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/creamy-mushroom-keto-casserole/#wprm-recipe-52663-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/creamy-mushroom-casserole-09.jpg"
